msgid "Defaults for new timers and the Record button. Each timer, and a recording started with \"Record with options…\", can change them.\nTS: video, all audio tracks, subtitles, teletext and EPG data. MKV: video, several audio tracks and subtitles. MPG: video and several audio tracks. MP4: video and one audio track. Internet streams have no teletext, subtitles or EPG data; HLS and DASH streams are recorded with one audio track."
msgstr "Defaults għal timers ġodda u għall-buttuna Irrekordja. Kull timer, u reġistrazzjoni mibdija b'“Irrekordja b'għażliet…”, jista' jibdilhom.\nTS: vidjo, il-binarji tal-awdjo kollha, sottotitoli, teletext u data tal-EPG. MKV: vidjo, diversi binarji tal-awdjo u sottotitoli. MPG: vidjo u diversi binarji tal-awdjo. MP4: vidjo u binarju tal-awdjo wieħed. Il-flussi tal-internet m'għandhomx teletext, sottotitoli jew data tal-EPG; il-flussi HLS u DASH jiġu rreġistrati b'binarju tal-awdjo wieħed."

